{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111953","id":2940634820,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6vRobE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111953","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111953.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111953.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111953","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111953/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111953/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111953/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ebb326426600ef022fcbe652f6dd7ff4621fb496","number":111953,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fixed invalid ping-pong in AnimationTree","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111719*\r\n- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111737*\r\n- *Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110982*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nThe `cur_time` is already processed as `pingpong`, it need not be subtract by `anim_size` again. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5950fca36cb311edcc72e479effed5c477d20adb/scene/animation/animation_blend_tree.cpp#L177\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5950fca36cb311edcc72e479effed5c477d20adb/scene/animation/animation_blend_tree.cpp#L213\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5950fca36cb311edcc72e479effed5c477d20adb/scene/animation/animation_blend_tree.cpp#L271-L277\r\n\r\n- When `cur_time` reached `anim_size`, e.g. `anim_size = 1.0`, `cur_time = 1.1`\r\n- Processed by `pingpong` related function, `cur_time = 0.9`, and `cur_backward=true`\r\n- The original code re-subtract `pi.time = anim_size - cur_playback_time`, then `pi.time` results `0.1`. So we cannot get `pingpong` function, and it looks like Sprite2D loop start from front.\r\n\r\n## BTW\r\n\r\nIn my testing, I suspects the `else` branch never be covered in original codes. The #110982 fixed condition issue, then the `else` branch issue is exposed.\r\n\r\n[pingpong.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94f1b991-3181-464f-bb6c-587fad73df72)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false